# 仓库维护：把大体积素材标成 binary，避免 git 做无意义的文本 diff、
# 也避免自动换行转换把这些文件判成"已修改"。
#
# 这里刻意不使用 Git LFS。免费额度是 1 GB 存储 + 每月 1 GB 流量，
# 每一次 clone 都会消耗流量，演示视频放 LFS 会让拉取变慢且容易爆额度。
# 真正需要瘦身时，按 docs/REPO_MAINTENANCE.md 的说明走 Releases，而不是 LFS。
*.mp4   binary
*.mov   binary
*.webm  binary
*.mkv   binary
*.avi   binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.ico   binary
*.glb   binary
*.gltf  binary
*.fbx   binary
*.obj   binary
*.stl   binary
*.bin   binary
*.pt    binary
*.pth   binary
*.onnx  binary
*.wasm  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3   binary
*.wav   binary
*.flac  binary
*.ogg   binary
*.m4a   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.7z    binary
*.db    binary
*.sqlite binary

# 代码与文档按真实换行提交，不吃 Windows 的 CRLF 自动转换。
*.ts    text eol=lf
*.tsx   text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.jsx   text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
*.cjs   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.prisma text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.svg   text eol=lf
